# Licensing and usage

This repository is not open source. Rights differ by asset class, so they are
set out separately below.

## Brand assets: Express Employment Professionals

The Express Employment Professionals name, the stylised "X", the logo lock-ups,
the tagline "Respecting People. Impacting Business.", and the brand colour
palette are the property of Express Services, Inc. and its subsidiaries.

"Express Employment Professionals" and the stylised "X" are registered trade
marks of Express Services, Inc.

The logo artwork in `logo/` is derived from files Express publishes for vendor
and press use at https://www.expresspros.com/newsroom/logos and from the lock-up
published on https://www.expressfranchising.com.au. Use is governed by the
Express Employment Professionals Brand Guide (a copy is at
`brand/express-brand-guide-2026-06.pdf`) and by the terms of the engagement
between Jiffi and Express Employment Professionals ANZ. It does not carry a
general licence to third parties.

Brand contact: Marketing and Communications, Express Employment International,
Marketing@ExpressPros.com.

## Fonts

| Family | Foundry | Licence | Vendored here |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Roboto | Google | Apache License 2.0 | Yes, `fonts/roboto/` |
| Roboto Condensed | Google | Apache License 2.0 | Yes, `fonts/roboto-condensed/` |
| Proxima Nova | Mark Simonson Studio | Commercial, per-seat and per-domain | **No** |
| Myriad Pro | Adobe | Adobe font licence | **No** |

Roboto and Roboto Condensed are redistributable under Apache 2.0. Full licence
text sits alongside the files in each family folder.

Proxima Nova is Express's print and collateral typeface and Myriad Pro Roman sets
the tagline lock-up. Both are commercially licensed and are deliberately **not**
included. Anyone producing print collateral needs their own licence. On screen,
Roboto is the approved substitute, on Express's own instruction in the brand
guide.

## Documentation and code

The markdown in `brand/`, the token definitions, the reference components in
`components/`, the examples in `examples/`, and the build scripts in `scripts/`
were written by Jiffi (https://jiffi.co) for Express Employment Professionals
ANZ. They are provided under the terms of that engagement and carry no general
licence.

## Photography

None is included. Every photograph on Express properties is licensed or
commissioned work that Express Employment International and its franchise
subsidiaries hold rights to use. Those rights do not extend to redistribution
here. See `brand/photography.md`.

## Third-party quotations

Statistics attributed to the American Staffing Association, Entrepreneur, Forbes,
Staffing Industry Analysts, and Great Place to Work belong to those
organisations. Reproduce them with attribution and check they are current before
publishing.
